<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - C/NET, Yahoo! started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - C/NET, Yahoo! started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of C/NET Inc as a buy and set a price target of $35 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cowen also started Yahoo! Inc as a strong buy and set a price target of $34 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects both companies to report strong quarterly earnings.</p>
<p>-- C/NET gained 1-5/8 to 30 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Yahoo! gained 1-1/8 to 20-3/8.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
